Hello,
would you mind reinstalling and trying again please?
It should now say
Ignoring .dtrash folder.
and likewise for the other mentioned folder, .mysql.digikam.

But I see the problem now is in recordTable, not imageRename. It may already be fixed in the github dev version (recordTable and recordTableIndividual now explicitly ignore .dtrash and .mysql.digikam, which likely caused the problem). These are hidden folders, I'm not sure why R lists them at all. Probably some sort of Mac issue.
If it still doesn't work please let me know.
Best regards,
Jürgen

